/*
 * Hartwick Atelier — THE COLLECTION INDEX (/collections)
 *
 * Aloha's Collection-page wireframe, 15 September 2026:
 *
 *   categories  ha-collection-categories  title, the category line, four photographs two by two
 *   register    ha-register               THE REGISTER — the same form as everywhere else
 *
 * Each tile is bound to a collection and links to it:
 *   Clothing        → apparel          (store title "APPAREL"; the wireframe says Clothing)
 *   Fine Silks      → fine-silk        (store title "FINE SILK SCARVES")
 *   Yoga            → yoga
 *   Fine Jewellery  → fine-jewellery
 *
 * ⚠️ PHOTOGRAPHS. Aloha's Drive was not to hand, so the pictures are the
 *    store's own files (Admin > Files), found by eye against her drawing:
 *      · Fine Silks      088_HARTWICK_FINESILK_PETITSQUARE01_SCARF_NATURALDYE_BLOCKPRINT.jpg
 *                        — the frame in the drawing.
 *      · Fine Jewellery  001_HARTWICK_LIMINAL_ALEXANDRIA_PENDANT_22K_GOLD_EMERALD.jpg
 *                        — the same photograph; the store's copy is cropped
 *                        tighter than hers (no hat brim).
 *      · Clothing        001_HARTWICK_HANDWOVEN_TRIBECA_SKIRT_KHADI_TOKYO_SHIRT_IKAT.jpg
 *                        — the same shoot, room and outfit; her frame (the
 *                        photograph on the dresser bottom-left, her to the
 *                        right) is not on the store. Nearest of the three.
 *    The fourth — the rolled yoga mat on stone — exists nowhere on the store
 *    (there are no yoga products yet), so the Yoga tile carries the Yoga
 *    collection's own header image as a STAND-IN until her file arrives.
 *    Picking an image on that block replaces it.
 *
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * NOTE: this file is also written by the Shopify theme editor. Shopify
 * validates a JSON template against each section's schema AS IT EXISTS ON THE
 * THEME when the template is uploaded, and silently drops any setting the
 * schema does not yet declare — push the sections before this file.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
